0..75 Comment "//! An operation with two outputs, division with remainder on the naturals,"
76..134 Comment "//! defined by rules over a helper that walks the dividend"
135..207 Comment "//! [Baader-1998-term_rewriting_and_all_that], § 4.1: a closed division"
208..282 Comment "//! normalizes to its quotient and remainder, and a run binds both. A call"
283..360 Comment "//! names each output by its port\'s label, as a function\'s call does. One run"
361..428 Comment "//! selects an output, and one pattern binds both in another order."
429..432 Comment "//!"
433..487 Comment "//! - cites: [Baader-1998-term_rewriting_and_all_that]"
